+## 2026-10-28 - Extract Rolling Analysis (v1169)
+
+- Move Rolling Analysis to its own application with PostgreSQL history and direct central data-agent access.
+- Remove its tab, assets and dedicated history endpoints from Risk; preserve other rolling charts, shared history routes and saved data.
+
 ## 2026-10-26 - Rolling lookback boundary (v1168)
 
 - Include the previous available close when a lookback begins on a weekend or holiday, correcting missing rolling values and percentile samples.
